    routePath: 'lupfen',
    LLM: 'Game: Lupfen. Swiss, 3-5 players, 36-card deck. Deal 9 each. Auction: bid Game/Solo/Grand. Declarer chooses trump. Play: must follow, must trump if void. Card values: A=11, 10=10, K=4, O=3, U=2. Need 61+ points to win.',
    Player: 'Welcome to Lupfen! This Swiss trick-taking game uses a 36-card deck. Bid for the right to choose trumps, then try to win 61+ points. Aces and Tens are valuableâ€”capture them with your trumps!',
